    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your association with death has become so close that you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Death's Lament.</strong> When you use Wails from the Grave, you can deal the feature's Necrotic damage to both the first and the second creature.</p><p><strong>Draw of Death.</strong> When you roll Initiative, you gain one soul trinket for your Tokens of the Departed if you have none remaining.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-o0FEJNUBtZRneA6q\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Regain the trinket on Initiative yourself.</p></section>",
